{"op":"add","path":"/elements/narrative","value":{"type":"TextBlock","props":{"variant":"body","content":"Net new MRR trended rising through Jan–Dec 2024, with a monthly OLS slope of 7351.7483 (p = 2.73e-14). The series reached its attested peak of $224,600.00 in December 2024 and closed at $224,600.00 — 0% from that peak. The early-half median was $164,300.00 vs. $207,900.00 in the second half (1.3×). Cumulative net new MRR trended rising (slope 189988.1119 per month, p = 1.03e-13). Gross adds totalled 2080000 from new customers and 363700 from expansion. No persistent step-change was detected in the monthly series. Analysis covered 12 months × 3 plans (Starter, Pro, Enterprise); each monthly aggregate combines exactly 3 plan rows with uniform weighting."},"children":[]}}}
